+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Redemption persistence
+
+- [x] 1.1 Add `src/repositories/redemptionRepository.ts` with a single `apply(orderId, couponCode, discountCents, createdAt)` that runs, inside one `BEGIN`/`COMMIT` (rolling back on error), `UPDATE orders SET discount_cents, final_amount_cents, coupon_code`, `INSERT INTO coupon_redemptions` and `UPDATE coupons SET used_count = used_count + 1`; verify with `npm run build`.
+- [x] 1.2 Add a focused test that seeds an order and coupon, performs a successful redemption, and asserts the order discount fields, exactly one `coupon_redemptions` row and `used_count + 1`; and asserts a failing redemption leaves order, redemptions and `used_count` unchanged.
+
+## 2. Business rules in the service
+
+- [x] 2.1 Extend `OrderService` to accept the coupon and redemption repositories, and implement `applyCoupon(id, body)` that trims/uppercases the code, applies the validation checks in precedence order using the injected `Clock`, computes the discount for FIXED/PERCENT with cap and clamp, delegates the write, and returns the refreshed order; verify with `npm run build`.
+- [x] 2.2 Add tests covering the discount calculations and boundaries (AC-01 to AC-06), code normalization (AC-10), validity-window boundaries (AC-07) and repeat use (AC-08); verify they pass under `npm test`.
+
+## 3. HTTP route and wiring
+
+- [x] 3.1 Register `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` in `src/routes/orders.ts` (parameter parsing only) and wire the new repositories into `OrderService` in `src/app.ts`; verify with `npm run build`.
+- [x] 3.2 Add integration tests asserting the 200 response equals `GET /orders/:id` (AC-14), every error code/status from the precedence table, usage exhaustion (AC-09 `used_count` + redemption row), and that rejections leave the database unchanged; verify they pass under `npm test`.
+
+## 4. Full verification
+
+- [x] 4.1 Run `npm run build` and confirm there are no type errors.
+- [x] 4.2 Run `npm test` and confirm the existing and new tests all pass.
+
+## Workflow follow-up
+
+- Archive the change after review requirements are satisfied and verify the archived result.
